        "created_at": "2015-01-03T02:33:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"dshields\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dshields/48/1968_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> dshields:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>jsz2 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>The goat the cat the dog the stick the fire the water the ox the angel of death killed drank extinguished burned hit bit ate was bought for two zuzim.&nbsp;Bonus points for anyone who recognizes the song that inspired this.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chad_Gadya\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chad_Gadya</a>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ding ding ding!</p>\n<p>Your prize is you get to go to the head ahead of the woman with a head on her head who is in danger of hitting her head on the head and knocking the head on her head off of her head in the head. &nbsp;Although perhaps the head on her head will stay on her head when she bumps her head in the head and she'll end up with a bruise on her head instead.</p>",
