        "created_at": "2015-01-06T03:46:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I knew this fact would come in handy!</p>\n<p>1797 the top hat is first worn in public by James Heatherington drawing a huge disorderly crowd, Heatherington is arrested and charged with causing a breach of the peace and for appearing on the public highway wearing a tall structure of a shining lustre and calculated to disturb timid people.</p>\n<p>Huzzah for the top hat!</p>\n<p>However, a top hat is not good enough for you, this is the hat you should wear.</p>\n<p><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/cc7761168d6594c79e0d209985bfea797fe5840a.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"taNaInDPzzz1dFeJROUhnSMJuHg\" width=\"599\" height=\"448\"></p>\n<p>and when you take it off you can eat it (it'll still be good in a month right?).</p>",
